sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client (Postman)
  participant S as #lt;#lt;javaScript#gt;#gt;<br/>:server
  participant RH as #lt;#lt;router#gt;#gt;<br/>:hotels
  participant RB as #lt;#lt;router#gt;#gt;<br/>:bookings
  participant A as #lt;#lt;middleware#gt;#gt;<br/>:auth
  participant K as #lt;#lt;controllers#gt;#gt;<br/>:bookings
  participant H as #lt;#lt;model#gt;#gt;<br/>:Hotel
  participant B as #lt;#lt;model#gt;#gt;<br/>:Booking
  participant D as #lt;#lt;MongoDB#gt;#gt;<br/>:bookings
  Note left of S: create booking
  C->>+S: req.post('/api/v1/hotels/:hotelId/bookings')<br/>{checkInDate, checkOutDate}
  S->>+RH: app.use('/api/v1/hotels', hotels)
  RH->>+RB: router.use('/:hotelId/bookings', bookings)
  RB->>+A: protect, authorize('admin','user')
  A-->>C: 401 if no or bad token
  A->>+K: addBooking (req.user)
  K->>+H: Hotel.findById(hotelId)
  H-->>-K: hotel (404 if none)
  K->>+B: Booking.create({hotel, user, dates})
  B->>B: check-out after check-in, 1 to 3 nights (else 400)
  B->>+D: BookingSchema
  D-->>-B: booking
  B-->>-K: booking
  K-->>-A: 
  A-->>-RB: 
  RB-->>-RH: 
  RH-->>-S: 
  S-->>-C: 201 {success, data: booking}
